FR:
Cette année, ce sera l'année du rat.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Hé hé... {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Mon année !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001C:}}J'aurai donc le droit de faire ce que
je veux...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bah, comme d'hab,
HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ça y est !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} C'est pas trop tôt !{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}On va
enfin entrer dans l'année du buffle !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Attention les yeux, ça va buffler...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Uzun zamandır neyi denemek istiyorum
biliyor musun? {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ayın üstünden atlamayı.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Evet, ne diyeceğini biliyorum.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}{{TAG:000D:0004:04CD}}"Ama {{TAG:0005:0001:}}, sen bir ineksin.
Ne klişe."{{TAG:000D:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Tamam, her şeye klişe diyelim.
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Belki ben hiç denemedim, tamam mı?!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Zor iş ama hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}yeni yıl gazıyla bile
büyük sıçrayış!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}You hear that?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}That, my friend, is
the sound of a new year upon us!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}You really can't hear it?
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}It's probably because your ears are
so small.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:001C:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:4B00}}Hah, funny-lookin' small-ears.
Prolly can't hear nothin' with those small ears...
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}Wha'zat? You can hear me? No way!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I didn't mean it! I take it back!{{TAG:0000:0002:4B00}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Duyuyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Dostum, o yeni yılın geliş sesi!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Gerçekten duyamıyor musun?
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Kulakların minicik diye herhâlde.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:001C:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:4B00}}Hah,
komik minik kulaklı. Onlarla hiçbir
şey duyamazsın...
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}Ne? Beni duyuyor musun? Olamaz!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Öyle demek istemedim! Geri aldım!{{TAG:0000:0002:4B00}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}

{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Pekâlâ, yeni yıl geldi; artık {{TAG:0003:0015:}}şu eski
ayakkabılarımı değiştirme vakti.
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Sözde daha sık değiştirmeliymişim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}ama her gün yıkanmam da "gerekiyormuş".
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Pöh, kimin vakti var?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}İşim gücüm var benim!

FR:
L'année des moutons et des chèvres
arrive...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Mais je ne suis pas un mouton, moi.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Je suis un mâle alpha, un meneur.

{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ça va être l'année{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} du singe !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Le vieux singe va enfin pouvoir
faire des grimaces en toute
impunité !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Sta arrivando{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} l'anno della Scimmia!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dovrete dare ascolto solo a me!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Ora devo solo scoprire
quando inizia l'anno secondo
il calendario lunare!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Wurde auch Zeit, dass das Jahr des
Affen endlich kommt!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Jetzt zeig ich euch, wer das Sagen
hat!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Nämlich ICH!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0004:0000:}} va a ser el año del gallo.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
¡Habrá un levantamiento
plumífero general!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Cette année, c'est mon année,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} je
vais être comme un coq en pâte...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Bah oui, {{TAG:0004:0000:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}ce sera l'année du
coq !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Este va a ser el año del perro!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡Me pienso reservar el derecho
de mover el rabo cuanto quiera!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ça va être l'année du chien, wouf
wouf !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}Je vais enfin pouvoir
montrer mes crocs !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Das Jahr des Hundes!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Zeit, ein paar Leuten in die Waden
zu beißen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}All right,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} as this year's unofficial
deputy mayor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:001C:}}I have authority over
everyone in town.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Como ayudante en funciones
no oficial de la alcaldía,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡este año mando yo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}En tant que conseiller municipal
autoproclamé,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:001C:}}il est temps pour
moi de prendre des décisions !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}So,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} als diesjähriger inoffizieller
Aushilfsbürgermeister darf ich jeden
herumkommandieren!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pekâlâ,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} bu yılın gayriresmî başkan
yardımcısı olarak,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:001C:}}kasabadaki herkes
üzerinde yetkim var.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}All right, this year is a contest
between me and that tree in the
event plaza!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}Who can grow more?!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}La gran pregunta del año va a ser:{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¿Quién crecerá más?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}¿Yo?
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} ¿O ese árbol de la plaza?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Cette année je lance un défi à
l'arbre de la place...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}Qui des deux
prendra le plus de hauteur ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}

IT:
