EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}First dream of the new year{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002B:}}I wanted to write down what I was
